---
// Odin's MCP server, shown as a Codex session using the real tool names.
---

<section class="section agents" aria-labelledby="agents-title">
	<div class="wrap agents__grid">
		<div class="agents__copy">
			<h2 id="agents-title">Your agents can work in Odin too.</h2>
			<p>
				Odin's MCP server gives ChatGPT, Codex, Claude and other MCP clients 121 tools, 48 that read and 73 that write. They
				cover projects and the full brief, epics, stories and tasks, the board, sprints, tickets, files, time and
				staffing, risks and milestones, workflows, comments, requirements feedback and review package uploads.
			</p>
			<ul class="agents__facts">
				<li><b>Your login.</b> Clients sign in through Odin, with MFA and SSO. ChatGPT, Codex and Claude need no client ID; an admin registers any other client once.</li>
				<li><b>Your scope.</b> You approve read or read-and-write access, and can limit it to the projects you choose.</li>
				<li><b>Safe writes.</b> Every write supports a dry run. An edit to a project, a single item or the brief carries the version it read, and Odin refuses it if someone changed the record since.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<figure class="terminal" data-demo aria-label="A Codex session reads a sprint from Odin and moves a story after a dry run.">
			<div class="terminal__bar" aria-hidden="true">
				<span class="frame__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
				<span>codex: harbor-portal</span>
			</div>
			<div class="terminal__body" aria-hidden="true">
				<p class="line sys" data-at="200">Connected to Odin MCP: read and write, 1 project</p>
				<p class="line you" data-at="700"><b>you</b> <span data-at="700" data-type data-speed="26">What's left in Sprint 15, and is anything blocked?</span></p>
				<p class="line tool" data-at="2300"><b>tool</b> odin_list_sprints <i>{"{"} projectId: "customer-portal" {"}"}</i></p>
				<p class="line tool" data-at="2800"><b>tool</b> odin_get_board <i>{"{"} filters: {"{"} sprintId: "sprint-15" {"}"} {"}"}</i></p>
				<p class="line ai" data-at="3600"><b>codex</b> 21 of 34 points are done and 6 stories are open. "Label printing service" waits on the carrier API sandbox, which is down until Oct 20.</p>
				<p class="line you" data-at="5200"><b>you</b> <span data-at="5200" data-type data-speed="26">Move "Make the return reason optional" to In review. Dry run first.</span></p>
				<p class="line tool" data-at="7300"><b>tool</b> odin_update_item <i>{"{"} input: {"{"} status: "In review", expectedVersion: 7 {"}"}, dryRun: true {"}"}</i></p>
				<p class="line ok" data-at="7900">dry run: the request is valid, nothing was sent</p>
				<p class="line tool" data-at="8700"><b>tool</b> odin_update_item <i>{"{"} input: {"{"} status: "In review", expectedVersion: 7 {"}"} {"}"}</i></p>
				<p class="line ok" data-at="9300">updated story-412, version 7 to 8, the board shows it in In review</p>
				<p class="line prompt" data-at="9800"><b>you</b> <span class="blink"></span></p>
			</div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</section>

<script>
	import { autoplayDemos } from '../../scripts/timeline';
	autoplayDemos('.agents [data-demo]');
</script>

<style>
	.agents {
		padding-top: 0;
	}
	.agents__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
		align-items: center;
	}
	.agents__copy h2 {
		font-size: var(--step-4);
	}
	.agents__copy > p {
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		font-size: var(--step-1);
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--ink-2);
	}
	.agents__facts {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.9rem;
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		color: var(--ink-2);
	}
	.agents__facts b {
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	.terminal {
		margin: 0;
		border-radius: var(--radius-m);
		background: #050b16;
		border: 1px solid #1b2b4b;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(242, 182, 54, 0.04);
		overflow: hidden;
		color: #c4d2e8;
	}
	.terminal__bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		height: 38px;
		padding: 0 0.9rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #1b2b4b;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: #6c7f9c;
	}
	.terminal__bar :global(.frame__dots i) {
		background: #2a3e66;
	}
	.terminal__body {
		display: grid;
		align-content: start;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		min-height: 420px;
		padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem 1.5rem;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.62rem + 0.25vw, 0.8rem);
		line-height: 1.65;
	}
	.line b {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 4.6em;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #6c7f9c;
	}
	.line i {
		font-style: normal;
		color: #8aa0c2;
	}
	.sys {
		color: #6c7f9c;
	}
	.you b {
		color: #f2b636;
	}
	.you span {
		color: #edf3fb;
	}
	.tool {
		color: #8db8ff;
	}
	.ai b {
		color: #a97bff;
	}
	.ok {
		padding-left: 4.6em;
		color: #3fd08f;
	}
	.prompt b {
		color: #f2b636;
	}
	.blink {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 0.55em;
		height: 1.1em;
		vertical-align: text-bottom;
		background: #f2b636;
		animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
	}
	@keyframes blink {
		50% {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 960px) {
		.agents__grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
